        "description": "__Height:__ 164 cm\n\nKlaudia is the daughter of wealthy travelling merchant. She possesses a refined aura and kind personality. She has an interest in music and practices playing the flute, but hides it from her father. When visiting Kurken Island she makes friends with [Ryza](https://anilist.co/character/223350/Stout-Reisalin), [Lent](https://anilist.co/character/300891/Marslink-Lent) and [Tao](https://anilist.co/character/300892/Mongarten-Tao), and becomes one of the members of the secret hideout. Together they share many adventures over the summer.",
